units           metal
atom_style      charge
boundary        p p p
atom_modify     map yes
newton          on

neighbor        1.0 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0 every 1 check yes
read_data       ../../01_input/sio2_quenched.data

pair_style      e3gnn
pair_coeff      * * ../../01_input/pot/deployed_serial.pt O Si

variable        fmag  atom  sqrt(fx*fx+fy*fy+fz*fz)
compute         maxf  all   reduce max v_fmag
variable        epa   equal pe/atoms

thermo_style    custom step pe v_epa press vol density c_maxf
thermo          1
run             0
